// Teeter, who runs the Safehouse radio. Obsessed with pre-city music. Source of rumours, and of a cat.
npc: teeter
name: Teeter
start: back [flag:met_teeter]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_teeter}
  teeter (excited): "You are the chute person! I am Teeter. I run the radio. Do not touch the dial, it is set to something illegal and wonderful. Can I tell you things? I have things."
  > "What things?" -> things
  > "Tell me about the cameras." -> cameras
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: things
  teeter: "Everyone talks to the radio, and I listen to everyone. Also I have a problem. I have lost a cat. Admiral Pancake. Grey, one ear, answers to nothing. If you see a cat, any cat, will you tell me? It is very important."
  on_enter: {+clue:cat_request(teeter)}
  > "I will keep an eye out." -> goodbye
  > "Tell me about the cameras." -> cameras

node: cameras
  on_enter: {+clue:stacks_cameras_night(teeter)}
  teeter (earnest): "The Stacks cameras go on a night schedule at two in the morning. The plaza one looks the other way for a while. Do not do anything silly with that."
  > "What about the hackers?" -> hackers
  > [!flag:sq_10_started] "What is the dial set to?" -> dial
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: dial
  on_enter: {flag:sq_10_started}
  teeter (rapturous): "A song! From before! One song, and I have never been able to play it, because the Safehouse set is too weak to reach the Civic Voice, and the Civic Voice only listens for ten minutes a night: nine to nine thirty. If somebody could route power through my rig and give it legs, I could play it into the PA. Everyone in the Stacks would hear it. Even the robots."
  > "I will try the rig." -> song
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: song
  teeter (earnest): "The rig is the grey box by the radio. Four by four, power in at the corner, three lamps to light. Once it is humming come and tell me, and be here between nine and half past nine."
  > [flag:radio_boosted, !flag:pirate_played] "It is humming. Play it." {service:pirate_broadcast} -> played
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: played
  teeter (overjoyed): "...Did you hear? Did you hear?! Admiral Pancake would have loved it. Thank you."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: hackers
  on_enter: {+clue:hackers_split(teeter)}
  teeter (hushed): "Null Hypothesis. They split up. Dex Harlow would not leave Mari Quade alone; Mari is the best friend of Juno, who was on the team. Juno took Dex's toolkit and left. It is the best thing that has happened in the Stacks since the lift broke."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  teeter: "Back! Any cats?"
  > [!flag:sq_10_started] "What is the dial set to?" -> dial
  > [flag:sq_10_started, !flag:radio_boosted] "About the song." -> song
  > [flag:radio_boosted, !flag:pirate_played] "Play it now." {service:pirate_broadcast} -> played
  > "Tell me about the cameras." -> cameras
  > "What about the hackers?" -> hackers
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: goodbye
  teeter: "Keep the dial where it is."
  end
